{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Framework_sig.Async_refused</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"spoc","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Spoc_framework","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Framework_sig","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Async_refused","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"Parameters","href":"#parameters","children":[]},{"title":"Signature","href":"#signature","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>The refusing implementation of <a href=\"../module-type-ASYNC/index.html\"><code>ASYNC</code></a>, for backends that do not provide it. Every operation raises <code>Feature_not_supported</code> naming the backend and the operation.</p>","content":"<h2 id=\"parameters\"><a href=\"#parameters\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Parameters</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec parameter anchored\" id=\"argument-1-X\"><a href=\"#argument-1-X\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> </span><span><a href=\"argument-1-X/index.html\">X</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"signature\"><a href=\"#signature\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Signature</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-device\"><a href=\"#type-device\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> device</span><span> = <a href=\"argument-1-X/index.html#type-device\">X.device</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-stream\"><a href=\"#type-stream\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> stream</span><span> = <a href=\"argument-1-X/index.html#type-stream\">X.stream</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-event\"><a href=\"#type-event\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> event</span><span> = <a href=\"argument-1-X/index.html#type-event\">X.event</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-buffer\"><a href=\"#type-buffer\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> <span>'a buffer</span></span><span> = <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"argument-1-X/index.html#type-buffer\">X.buffer</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-support\"><a href=\"#val-support\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> support : <a href=\"../index.html#type-async_support\">async_support</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-host_to_device\"><a href=\"#val-host_to_device\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> host_to_device : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">src_ptr</span>:nativeint <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">dst</span>:<span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-buffer\">buffer</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">dst_offset</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">byte_size</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">stream</span>:<span><a href=\"#type-stream\">stream</a> option</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-device_to_host\"><a href=\"#val-device_to_host\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> device_to_host : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">src</span>:<span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-buffer\">buffer</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">src_offset</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">dst_ptr</span>:nativeint <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">byte_size</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">stream</span>:<span><a href=\"#type-stream\">stream</a> option</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-stream_wait_event\"><a href=\"#val-stream_wait_event\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> stream_wait_event : <span><a href=\"#type-stream\">stream</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-event\">event</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>All work enqueued on the stream after this call waits until the work recorded by the event has completed.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-event_query\"><a href=\"#val-event_query\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> event_query : <span><a href=\"#type-event\">event</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>true</code> once the work recorded by the event has completed (or the event was never recorded); never blocks.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-alloc_pinned\"><a href=\"#val-alloc_pinned\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> alloc_pinned : <span><a href=\"#type-device\">device</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">byte_size</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> nativeint</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Page-locked host memory of <code>byte_size</code> bytes, returned as a raw address. Released by <a href=\"#val-free_pinned\"><code>free_pinned</code></a>. A backend whose pinned memory belongs to the device (Vulkan: a driver mapping) unmaps it when the device is destroyed; the address is then invalid and only <a href=\"#val-free_pinned\"><code>free_pinned</code></a> may still be called on it.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-free_pinned\"><a href=\"#val-free_pinned\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> free_pinned : <span><a href=\"#type-device\">device</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>nativeint <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-register_host\"><a href=\"#val-register_host\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> register_host : <span><a href=\"#type-device\">device</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>nativeint <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">byte_size</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Page-lock existing host memory for DMA. The caller keeps it alive until <a href=\"#val-unregister_host\"><code>unregister_host</code></a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-unregister_host\"><a href=\"#val-unregister_host\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> unregister_host : <span><a href=\"#type-device\">device</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>nativeint <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div>"}